      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/jul/31/british-azerbaijani-man-arrested-cyprus-alleged-spying-uk-airbase-iran",
      "description": "<p>Rashad Sultanov, from London, suspected of conducting hostile surveillance and passing information to Revolutionary Guards</p><p>A British-Azerbaijani national has been arrested ⁠in Cyprus on suspicion of spying on a British airbase on the Mediterranean island and passing information to Iran’s ⁠Islamic Revolutionary Guard ⁠Corps, the Metropolitan police ​said.</p><p>Rashad Sultanov, 44, from Islington, north London, was arrested on 17 July by Cypriot authorities ⁠and is being held in custody as extradition proceedings continue, the police said in a statement on Friday.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/jul/31/british-azerbaijani-man-arrested-cyprus-alleged-spying-uk-airbase-iran\">Continue reading...</a>",
